 "summary": "The post-PR surface is minimal and complete: no compatibility residue (one definition each of `tMin`/`tMinElastic`, old name kept, no shim), the two general bilinear-form facts are public in `LightConeBasis.lean` rather than private helpers, bodies stay unexposed with `:= (rfl)` def-lemmas, and each new definition carries a characteristic API that downstream uses without unfolding. `@[simp]` annotations are on the normal forms and are confluent; the two reparametrization lemmas are correctly left un-annotated.",
